Author: Pratheek555 <pratheekravikumar55@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 11 11:53:04 2026 +0530

    Switch the loaded mod from the chat and guard against stale main-process code

    - Live view shows which studio mod is on the server and offers "Load <mod>"
      for the chat you're in (studio:load); deploys are queued so a manual switch
      never overlaps a pipeline deploy
    - Benana watches its main-process files; when they change, a banner offers a
      one-click restart and new builds are refused until then
    - npm run dev runs Electron through scripts/dev-electron.cjs, which relaunches
      it on restart without stopping Vite; the game comes back up after a restart
      and the open chat is remembered
    - Fix primary game buttons rendering light text on a light background

